      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去挑战这两位代表时代的马娘，\n让出道前的我赢过她们……是这样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f627387f49ac527221bd4aed0e03fecb8b0628c39e641b165368534e3d1532e2",
