      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "完成上述事件后——再让她决定要不要正式签约，\n几天前我这样请求道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f960c341914fd426f755ee1e1fe5c18c97282ca9a42813e69ffedc8c9e750d5c",
