    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753d849668489ff4ebefadce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此，自己不知不觉间就被抛在了身后。\n……但是，即便如此我还是没打算放弃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dff5e8d88544975308130811abbe4befb93f1d2bdccbc14077cc265372cb94f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
